4730 An ownership fixture checked and dumped on two platforms; each dump re-checks every core module from source (`no_pack`, ownership-checker.md §16.9), which is nearly all of its cost. Measured 4 296M on master 8c9f737e0 and 4 301M with the near-linear read-off and condition instantiation of #220 (#230, #231), whose own share is about 5M. This grant adds 10% to 4 301M. Remove it when the ownership dump installs the checked core's summaries rather than re-checking core (issue #214).
